    [
     1,
     "<p dir=\"ltr\">Hi,</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">- see xlab() and ylab()<br>\r\n- you will have to calculate intersection points and plot circles on those coordinates<br>\r\n- map line thickness in aes() to that variable<br>\r\n- ibidem</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">You might want to check out <a href=\"http://docs.ggplot2.org/current/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://docs.ggplot2.org/current/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792368245348000&amp;usg=AOvVaw31ihK_A5QDPQwTWmoPvj7k\">http://docs.ggplot2.org/current/</a></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Cheers,<br>\r\nRoman</p>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
